{"format":"rezono.module/2","module":{"annotations":{"layer":"facts"},"decls":[{"derived":[],"description":"Expected offer terms and optional observed price and stock for a SKU.","kind":"PreflightOffer","slots":[{"constraints":[{"minimum":"0"}],"slot":"expected_price","type":"Int"},{"constraints":[{"minimum":"0"}],"slot":"required_stock","type":"Int"},{"card":"?","constraints":[{"minimum":"0"}],"slot":"observed_price","type":"Int"},{"card":"?","constraints":[{"minimum":"0"}],"slot":"observed_stock","type":"Int"}],"world":"closed"},{"lines":["// Read-only offer preflight: compare expected price and required stock against","// observed price and stock for a SKU, keeping an unread observation absent.","",".decl preflight_has_expected_price(sku: symbol)","preflight_has_expected_price(sku) :- preflight_offer__expected_price(sku, _).","",".decl preflight_has_required_stock(sku: symbol)","preflight_has_required_stock(sku) :- preflight_offer__required_stock(sku, _).","",".decl preflight_has_observed_price(sku: symbol)","preflight_has_observed_price(sku) :- preflight_offer__observed_price(sku, _).","",".decl preflight_has_observed_stock(sku: symbol)","preflight_has_observed_stock(sku) :- preflight_offer__observed_stock(sku, _).","",".decl preflight_price_conflict(sku: symbol)","preflight_price_conflict(sku) :- preflight_offer__expected_price(sku, a), preflight_offer__expected_price(sku, b), a != b.","preflight_price_conflict(sku) :- preflight_offer__observed_price(sku, a), preflight_offer__observed_price(sku, b), a != b.","",".decl preflight_stock_conflict(sku: symbol)","preflight_stock_conflict(sku) :- preflight_offer__required_stock(sku, a), preflight_offer__required_stock(sku, b), a != b.","preflight_stock_conflict(sku) :- preflight_offer__observed_stock(sku, a), preflight_offer__observed_stock(sku, b), a != b.","",".decl preflight_price_finding(sku: symbol, finding: symbol)","preflight_price_finding(sku, \"price_unknown\") :-","    preflight_offer(sku),","    !preflight_has_expected_price(sku).","preflight_price_finding(sku, \"price_unknown\") :-","    preflight_offer(sku),","    !preflight_has_observed_price(sku).","preflight_price_finding(sku, \"price_unknown\") :-","    preflight_offer(sku),","    preflight_price_conflict(sku).","preflight_price_finding(sku, \"price_changed\") :-","    preflight_offer(sku),","    preflight_offer__expected_price(sku, expected),","    preflight_offer__observed_price(sku, observed),","    !preflight_price_conflict(sku),","    observed != expected.","",".decl preflight_stock_finding(sku: symbol, finding: symbol)","preflight_stock_finding(sku, \"stock_unknown\") :-","    preflight_offer(sku),","    !preflight_has_required_stock(sku).","preflight_stock_finding(sku, \"stock_unknown\") :-","    preflight_offer(sku),","    !preflight_has_observed_stock(sku).","preflight_stock_finding(sku, \"stock_unknown\") :-","    preflight_offer(sku),","    preflight_stock_conflict(sku).","preflight_stock_finding(sku, \"insufficient_stock\") :-","    preflight_offer(sku),","    preflight_offer__required_stock(sku, required),","    preflight_offer__observed_stock(sku, observed),","    !preflight_stock_conflict(sku),","    observed < required.","",".decl preflight_finding(sku: symbol, finding: symbol)","preflight_finding(sku, finding) :- preflight_price_finding(sku, finding).","preflight_finding(sku, finding) :- preflight_stock_finding(sku, finding).","",".decl preflight_finding_rank(sku: symbol, rank: number, finding: symbol)","preflight_finding_rank(sku, 0, finding) :- preflight_price_finding(sku, finding).","preflight_finding_rank(sku, 1, finding) :- preflight_stock_finding(sku, finding).","",".output preflight_finding",".output preflight_finding_rank"],"rules":"preflight"}],"defaultRange":"Text","description":"Read-only offer preflight inputs comparing expected price and required stock against observed price and stock for a SKU.","imports":["linkml:types"],"iri":"https://rezono.org/examples/run/offer-selection/preflight","language":"en","pack":"offer-selection","rezono":"0","schema":"offer_selection_preflight","use":[]},"spans":[{"at":"","end":"63","line":"4","start":"38"},{"at":"/decls/0","end":"375","line":"12","start":"361"},{"at":"/decls/0/slots/0","end":"491","line":"14","start":"477"},{"at":"/decls/0/slots/0/constraints/0","end":"508","line":"15","start":"501"},{"at":"/decls/0/slots/1","end":"527","line":"16","start":"513"},{"at":"/decls/0/slots/1/constraints/0","end":"544","line":"17","start":"537"},{"at":"/decls/0/slots/2","end":"563","line":"18","start":"549"},{"at":"/decls/0/slots/2/constraints/0","end":"581","line":"19","start":"574"},{"at":"/decls/0/slots/3","end":"600","line":"20","start":"586"},{"at":"/decls/0/slots/3/constraints/0","end":"618","line":"21","start":"611"},{"at":"/decls/1","end":"637","line":"23","start":"628"}]}